---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy">
  <section class="page-intro shell-reading"><div class="section-kicker">Privacy</div><h1>Privacy without theatre.</h1></section>
  <section class="shell-reading article-body">
    <p>BEN ON DELIVERY collects only the information you choose to provide through contact forms and comments, plus basic technical information needed to operate and protect the website.</p>
    <h2>Contact form</h2><p>Name, email and message are required. Phone is optional. Contact submissions are used to respond to you and manage the conversation.</p>
    <h2>Comments</h2><p>Comments require a public name and private email address. Email is used for comment administration and reply notifications and is not displayed publicly.</p>
    <h2>Third parties</h2><p>The site may use Netlify for hosting and forms and Hyvor Talk for commenting. This page should be reviewed and expanded before public launch to reflect the final production configuration and applicable privacy obligations.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
